From: Riley <oreo4455@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] soc: qcom: add L16 bring-up canary (panic reset to stock, boot stage resets)

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/kernel/setup.c b/arch/arm64/kernel/setup.c
index 23c05dc7a..f09c14e24 100644
